GIVETH A MAYBE `Pena cominada`
@nlg:en the limits of the penalty for this case under art. 299 once the causes and any attempt reduction are applied
`os limites da pena do art. 299 com as causas` f MEANS
    `os limites para essas formas com as causas` f (LIST `falsidade ideológica (art. 299)`) (`as causas de aumento do art. 299` f)

