GIVETH A MAYBE `Pena cominada`
@nlg:en the limits of the penalty for this case under art. 300 once any attempt reduction is applied
`os limites da pena do art. 300` f MEANS
    `os limites para essas formas com as causas` f (LIST `falso reconhecimento de firma ou letra (art. 300)`) EMPTY

